# =============================================================================
# Docker build context exclusions (repository root)
# =============================================================================
# apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile build from the repository root
# (workspace packages and the root package-lock.json must be reachable), so the
# context is the whole repo and trimming it matters.
#
# Do NOT exclude: package.json, package-lock.json, tsconfig.base.json,
# apps/*/package.json, packages/ (workspace packages are copied whole),
# scripts/, apps/api/prisma/, apps/api/assets/ or apps/api/scripts/.
# =============================================================================

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.gitignore
worktrees
.claude
.vscode
.idea

# Secrets and local environment must never enter an image layer
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Test artifacts and coverage
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/junit.xml
**/test-results.json
tests

# Infrastructure, CI, docs and media (not needed by the app images)
infra
.github
docs
media
*.md
!packages/**/README.md

**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
**/logs
**/*.log
**/.cache
